  "sourceTitle": "Pineapple Cheese Cake",
  "sourceText": "Pineapple Cheese Cake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 19, 2009 - 12:34am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 pkt Cream cheese, (8 oz.) softened\n1 cup Powdered sugar\n2 pkt Dream Whip, (2 envelopes)\n1 cup Milk\n2 can (Large) crushed pineapple, drained\nCookie crust\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Beat Dream Whip with milk. Set aside. Beat cream cheese with powdered sugar. Drain pineapple. Add to cream cheese mixture. Fold in Dream Whip. 2 Pour into cookie crust and refrigerate.",
